  "All Quiet on the Western Front": "A young German soldier of World War I tells of a generation of men who, even though they may have escaped shells, were destroyed by the war.",
  "Anna Karenina": "Tolstoy’s tragic epic of love and society in imperial Russia, weaving Anna’s doomed affair with Count Vronsky against Levin’s quieter search for meaning.",
